01:29:06.200 --> 01:29:07.360
Any buyers?

01:29:07.740 --> 01:29:10.000
Yes. We only have one buyer right now.

01:29:10.100 --> 01:29:11.300
His name is John B.

01:29:11.360 --> 01:29:13.800
He's a legend in the nostalgia circles.

01:29:13.800 --> 01:29:16.360
He donates to the podcast every month.

01:29:16.520 --> 01:29:19.080
You don't have to, but we'll think less of you.

01:29:21.000 --> 01:29:22.000
Right now, John B's the end of the deal.

01:29:22.000 --> 01:29:22.940
It's not that we think less of you.

01:29:23.020 --> 01:29:24.720
It's just that we think more of John B.

01:29:24.920 --> 01:29:25.860
Oh, yeah. I like that.

01:29:26.080 --> 01:29:28.960
Yeah, yeah, yeah. We just think not more of you.

01:29:29.120 --> 01:29:34.460
The problem is that when I go to sleep at night, you know, I'm not thinking of all of the listeners.

01:29:34.460 --> 01:29:36.340
I'm just thinking about John B.

01:29:36.440 --> 01:29:38.700
Who is no longer a listener after this episode.

01:29:40.820 --> 01:29:43.540
If it makes anybody feel better, I don't know what John B looks like.

01:29:46.280 --> 01:29:48.580
That's all the time we have for this episode.

01:29:48.780 --> 01:29:49.880
That's our end. Nostalgia.

01:29:51.040 --> 01:29:53.720
Join us next time for Rad Racer.

